Translate the following Markdown content to {{target_language}}.

Source Markdown:
```markdown
{{current_content}}
```

Requirements:
- Preserve ALL Markdown formatting (headings, lists, code blocks, tables, links, images)
- Keep code blocks unchanged (do not translate code)
- Keep URLs and link targets unchanged
- Translate only human-readable text
- Maintain front matter if present (translate title/description only)
- Output only the translated Markdown

{{#if context}}
Additional context: {{context}}
{{/if}}